<h1>Expressions</h1>

<p>A simple expression looks up a value: Hello, {{firstname}} {{lastname}}!</p>

<p>Nested paths walk into objects: {{person.name}} leads {{person.team}}.</p>

<p>By default, values are HTML-escaped: {{html}}</p>
<p>Triple-stash emits raw HTML: {{{html}}}</p>
<p>…and so does the ampersand form: {{&html}}</p>

<p>Segment-literal notation reads keys with spaces or symbols: {{person.[home town]}}.</p>

<ul>
  {{#each tags}}<li>this = {{this}}</li>{{/each}}
</ul>
